OL,3,GNEWSA'We had Trump and Wonka at our
OL,4,AHalloween tournament'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman who created a netball network
OL,7,Fto help people make new friends has
OL,8,Fhosted a Halloween tournament where
OL,9,F"fancy dress was compulsory" while
OL,10,F"playing a bit of netball was in the
OL,11,Fbackground."
OL,13,FIzzy Mills, 28, from Lytham, in
OL,14,FLancashire, thought she would "never
OL,15,Fmeet [her] tribe" after struggling with
OL,16,Ffriendships at school.
OL,18,FIzzy now runs a network of 30 different
OL,19,Fclubs across the North West, called
OL,20,FNice Netball.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
